      "default": "CLEAR",
      "description": "Chapter 3 P1 \u2014 research attention state. Flags questionable or potentially valuable merchandise for another look instead of pricing to keep moving. INDEPENDENT of Item.status, SaleClientDecision, price and availability \u2014 human-controlled only; AI may suggest but never set it.",
